WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
I've found everyone's way to the church

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,840
Just hunt the hounds

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,520
When the quantity reaches a certain amount

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,320
A key will drop

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,920
With this key you can enter the church

6
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,160
And the hound will not attack the person holding the key

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,440
Kill the hound

8
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,720
get key

9
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,800
That is to say

10
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:22,130
Sikong Lan has already obtained the key

11
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:29,250
Let’s kill the hound first and then talk about it

12
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:31,210
Are you so fierce, giving away your head? This is

13
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:34,890
Both heads are here

14
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:42,060
Slipping away

15
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,820
Come and eat one. Eating some fruit can make your skin look better.
